// Optional. Copy to Config/Local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in. Orbit.xcconfig includes it last, so values
// here win; without the file Orbit builds signed ad hoc with no Client ID.

// Client ID of your app in the Spotify Developer Dashboard, with redirect URI http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback.
// Left empty, users enter one in Orbit's settings, which also takes precedence over this build-time value.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID =

// Optional: sign with a real identity instead of ad hoc. A stable signature stops macOS from re-asking for
// Keychain and Automation access after every build. Any Apple Development certificate works, including the free
// one Xcode creates for an Apple ID. DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is the certificate's Organizational Unit, not the code in
// parentheses in its name; this prints it:
//   security find-certificate -c "Apple Development" -p | openssl x509 -noout -subject
// CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual
// CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
